---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "お役立ち記事一覧"
description: "外国人雇用企業のコンプライアンスを中心に、制度改正や審査基準の最新情報をまとめた記事一覧です。"
permalink: /articles/
navActive: articles
---
<div class="article-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">トップ</a> ／ お役立ち記事一覧
    </div>
    <p class="label-eyebrow" style="color:rgba(196,161,94,.8)">Column</p>
    <h1 class="article-hero-title">お役立ち記事一覧</h1>
    <div class="article-hero-meta">
      <span>外国人雇用企業のコンプライアンスを中心に、制度改正や審査基準の最新情報をまとめています。</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="services-section" id="articles">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="articles-grid" style="margin-top:0;">
      {% for article in collections.articles %}
      <a href="{{ article.url }}" class="article-card reveal reveal-delay-{{ loop.index0 % 3 + 1 }}">
        <img src="{{ article.data.image }}" alt="{{ article.data.imageAlt or article.data.title }}" style="width:100%;height:160px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;display:block;">
        <div class="article-body">
          <span class="article-cat">{{ article.data.category }}</span>
          <div class="article-title">{{ article.data.title }}</div>
          <div class="article-date">{{ article.data.datePublished | cardDate }}</div>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
